sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant DB as Migrate Working DB
    participant Source as Replicate Source Connector
    participant Cloud as Cloud Replicate
    participant Target as Replicate SAP Target Connector
    participant Catalog as SKP Catalog
    participant Scanner as Scanner
    participant API as HTTP API
    participant Worker1 as Worker 1
    participant Worker2 as Worker 2
    participant Worker3 as Worker 3
    participant WorkerN as Worker N
    participant Commit as Batch Commit per Worker

    DB->>Source: Replicate migration data
    Source->>Cloud: Send replicated data
    Cloud->>Target: Deliver replicated data
    Target->>API: Submit processing request

    Scanner->>Catalog: Request SKP catalog data
    Catalog-->>Scanner: Return SKP catalog data
    Scanner->>API: Submit scan result
    API-->>Scanner: Return processing response

    rect rgb(49, 134, 46)
        Note over Worker1,WorkerN: Parallel Processing
        par Worker 1
            API->>Worker1: Dispatch request
            Worker1->>Worker1: Process batch
            Worker1->>Commit: Commit batch
        and Worker 2
            API->>Worker2: Dispatch request
            Worker2->>Worker2: Process batch
            Worker2->>Commit: Commit batch
        and Worker 3
            API->>Worker3: Dispatch request
            Worker3->>Worker3: Process batch
            Worker3->>Commit: Commit batch
        and Worker N
            API->>WorkerN: Dispatch request
            WorkerN->>WorkerN: Process batch
            WorkerN->>Commit: Commit batch
        end
    end